  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>A <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-python/releases/tag/2020-06-16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">new release</a> of the <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python SDK v2 for Azure IoT</a> is now available. This update fixes issues with reconnection logic. Before upgrading, read about&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-python/wiki/pitfalls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">common pitfalls</a>&nbsp;with this release. Or if&nbsp;you&#39;re new to Python SDK v2,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/internet-of-things/new-version-of-the-python-sdk-released/ba-p/1201894\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">learn more</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please continue to share your feedback on <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-python/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Github</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "A new release of the Python SDK v2 for Azure IoT is now available. This update fixes issues with reconnection logic. Before upgrading, read about common pitfalls with this release. Or if you're new to Python SDK v2, learn more .\n\nPlease continue to share your feedback on Github ."
  },
